{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Temporal.Zone_offset</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"hegel","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Hegel","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Generators","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Temporal","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Zone_offset","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>The offset a zone has in force at an instant; see <a href=\"../index.html#val-offset_at\"><code>offset_at</code></a>.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.offset\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.offset\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>offset : <a href=\"../Offset/index.html#type-t\">Offset.t</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.is_dst\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.is_dst\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>is_dst : bool;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.abbreviation\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.abbreviation\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>abbreviation : string;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>is_dst</code> is the database's daylight-saving flag, informational only, and <code>abbreviation</code> the abbreviation in force, such as <code>EST</code>, or <code>-00</code> when the offset is unknown.</p></div></div>"}